port, conditional allowances, application payment and matriculation fees. Use a current-intake task sheet and funding checklist.\",\"image\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/images/day25/application-workspace-1280.webp\",\"datePublished\":\"2026-11-23\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-11-23\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"AspireCompass Editorial Team\",\"url\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/editorial-policy/\"},\"publisher\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"AspireCompass\",\"logo\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"url\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/logo.svg\"}},\"mainEntityOfPage\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/scholarships/gist-graduate-scholarship/\"}"}}],["$","script","3",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Does GIST require a separate scholarship application?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"The international graduate FAQ says scholarships are granted without a separate application process. Complete the correct admission application and all its requirements.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Does scholarship handling remove the application fee?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"No. The FAQ says the application is not valid for processing until the designated application fee is paid.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can I use the public housing or assistantship figures as 2027 rates?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Some figures are explicitly labelled 2022. Check current applicable amounts and project or academic conditions instead of presenting those dated values as guaranteed 2027 support.\"}}]}"}}]],"$L19",false,"$L1a","$L1b"]}]
