rocessed as valid until its designated application fee has been paid. Keep those two facts together: automatic scholarship handling is not permission to skip admission requirements or payment."}],"$L1c"],"$undefined","$L1d","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$L1e","$undefined"]}]]}],false,false,false,false,"$L1f",false,"$L20","$L21"]}],"$L22"]}]
