1c:["$","p","Use the owner’s current schedule to identify the intended intake and permitted submission period. This review does not turn the presence of an online admissions website into confirmation that a particular 2027 round is open. Record the exact call and category before arranging documents. A general programme page and a currently accepting intake are different pieces of evidence.",{"children":"Use the owner’s current schedule to identify the intended intake and permitted submission period. This review does not turn the presence of an online admissions website into confirmation that a particular 2027 round is open. Record the exact call and category before arranging documents. A general programme page and a currently accepting intake are different pieces of evidence."}]
