1f:["$","article",null,{"className":"article-body article-body--guide","children":[null,["$","section","1-Do not combine a tuition waiver with a promise of zero cost",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-2","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Do not combine a tuition waiver with a promise of zero cost"}],[["$","p","The owner FAQ identifies a one-timeKRW 680,000 matriculation fee. The support page notes possible exemptions, which should be checked for the individual case rather than assumed. Admission-related charges are distinct from tuition support, and the application fee is a separate payment again.",{"children":"The owner FAQ identifies a one-timeKRW 680,000 matriculation fee. The support page notes possible exemptions, which should be checked for the individual case rather than assumed. Admission-related charges are distinct from tuition support, and the application fee is a separate payment again."}],["$","p","Create a ledger before accepting or paying: charge, due date, exemption or support basis, and amount you must supply. If an exemption is pending, keep the full charge in the confirmed-cost scenario. A positive scholarship description cannot settle when a particular fee is due or whether the bank transfer cost is included.",{"children":"Create a ledger before accepting or paying: charge, due date, exemption or support basis, and amount you must supply. If an exemption is pending, keep the full charge in the confirmed-cost scenario. A positive scholarship description cannot settle when a particular fee is due or whether the bank transfer cost is included."}]],"$undefined",[["$","p",null,{"className":"table-scroll-hint","children":"On a small screen, scroll the table sideways to compare all columns."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"guide-table-wrap","role":"region","aria-label":"Do not combine a tuition waiver with a promise of zero cost","tabIndex":0,"children":["$","table",null,{"className":"guide-table","children":[["$","caption",null,{"child