tes tuition, student and meal allowances, international allowance, project research assistance, insurance and flight reimbursement. It attaches credit or GPA conditions to some allowances. It also explicitly labels assistantship averages and housing figures as 2022 data. Those dated numbers should not be presented as guaranteed 2027 rates.",{"children":"GIST’s public support page separates tuition, student and meal allowances, international allowance, project research assistance, insurance and flight reimbursement. It attaches credit or GPA conditions to some allowances. It also explicitly labels assistantship averages and housing figures as 2022 data. Those dated numbers should not be presented as guaranteed 2027 rates."}],"$L23"],"$undefined","$L24","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$L25","$undefined"]}],"$L26","$L27","$L28"]}]
