23:["$","p","Use the table as a map of questions, then request the current applicable figures and terms where necessary. Keep a project-dependent research payment separate from an unconditional monthly award. Check reimbursement timing before treating travel support as money available to buy the ticket. Housing availability, utilities and deposits also need their own current evidence.",{"children":"Use the table as a map of questions, then request the current applicable figures and terms where necessary. Keep a project-dependent research payment separate from an unconditional monthly award. Check reimbursement timing before treating travel support as money available to buy the ticket. Housing availability, utilities and deposits also need their own current evidence."}]
24:[["$","p",null,{"className":"table-scroll-hint","children":"On a small screen, scroll the table sideways to compare all columns."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"guide-table-wrap","role":"region","aria-label":"Read the conditions and age of the funding table","tabIndex":0,"children":["$","table",null,{"className":"guide-table","children":[["$","caption",null,{"children":"Read the conditions and age of the funding table"}],["$","thead",null,{"children":["$","tr",null,{"children":[[["$","th","Record",{"scope":"col","children":"Record"}],["$","th","Check",{"scope":"col","children":"Check"}],["$","th","Action",{"scope":"col","children":"Action"}]],"$undefined"]}]}],["$","tbody",null,{"children":[["$","tr","0",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"Student or meal allowance"}],["$","td","1",{"children":"Academic conditions on public table"}],["$","td","2",{"children":"Check applicable semester rules"}]],"$undefined"]}],["$","tr","1",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"Research assistance"}],["$","td","1",{"children":"Project participation and dated averages"}],["$","td","2",{"children":"Do not guarantee a 2027 amount"}]],"$undefined"]}],["$","tr","2",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"Housing and travel"}],["$","td","1",{"children":"Availability, charges and reimbursement"}],["$","td","2",{"children":"Budget cash needed before receipt"}]],"$undefined"]}]]}]]}]}],"$undefined"]
25:["$","p",null,{"className":"table-source","children":["Official reference: ",[["$","span","https://www.gist.ac.kr/iadm/html/sub04/0401.html",{"children":["",["$","a",null,{"href":"https://www.gist.ac.kr/iadm/html/sub04/0401.html","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":"GIST: financial support components and dated tables"}]]}]]]}]
26:["$","section","3-Make the document set consistent across the degree stages",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-4","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Make the document set consistent across the degree stages"}],[["$","p","The graduate document list and FAQ should be read together for the intended application. Record the academic record, degree or expected-graduation evidence, translations or certification and any later originals required. A final-semester applicant needs to distinguish the evidence accepted for applying from final documents needed after admission.",{"children":"The graduate document list and FAQ should be read together for the intended application. Record the academic record, degree or expected-graduation evidence, translations or certification and any later originals required. A final-semester applicant needs to distinguish the evidence accepted for applying from final documents needed after admission."}],["$","p","An original document register can use four fields: issuing institution, degree stage, document status and required destination. A doctoral applicant with two degrees should not assume that one master’s transcript resolves every bachelor’s record task. Keep names and dates consistent, and ask the admissions office about a genuine discrepancy before altering a document. Use the exact current document list instead of a generic scholarship checklist.",{"children":"An original document register can use four fields: issuing institution, degree stage, document status and required destination. A doctoral applicant with two degrees should not assume that one master’s transcript resolves every bachelor’s record task. Keep names and dates consistent, and ask the admissions office about a genuine discrepancy before altering a document. Use the exact current document list instead of a generic scholarship checklist."}]],"$undefined",[["$","p",null,{"className":"table-scroll-hint","children":"On a small screen, scroll the table sideways to compare all columns."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"guide-table-wrap","role":"region","aria-label":"Make the document set consistent across the degree stages","tabIndex":0,"children":["$","table",null,{"className":"guide-table","children":[["$","caption",null,{"children":"Make the document set consistent across the degree stages"}],["$","thead",null,{"children":["$","tr",null,{"children":[[["$","th","Record",{"scope":"col","children":"Record"}],["$","th","Check",{"scope":"col","children":"Check"}],["$","th","Action",{"scope":"col","children":"Action"}]],"$undefined"]}]}],["$","tbody",null,{"children":[["$","tr","0",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"Interim academic evidence"}],["$","td","1",{"children":"What is accepted to apply?"}],["$","td","2",{"children":"Record final-document follow-up"}]],"$undefined"]}],["$","tr","1",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"Language and certification"}],["$","td","1",{"children":"Required form and permitted method"}],["$","td","2",{"children":"Check before paying for services"}]],"$undefined"]}],["$","tr","2",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"Final verification"}],["$","td","1",{"children":"Original or certified records where required"}],["$","td","2",{"children":"Track the post-admission deadline"}]],"$undefined"]}]]}]]}]}],"$undefined"],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","p",null,{"className":"table-source","children":["Official reference: ",[["$","span","https://www.gist.ac.kr/iadm/html/sub02/020103.html",{"children":["",["$","a",null,{"href":"https://www.gist.ac.kr/iadm/html/sub02/020103.html","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":"GIST: required international graduate documents"}]]}],["$","span","https://www.gist.ac.kr/iadm/html/sub05/0503.html",{"children":[" · ",["$","a",null,{"href":"https://www.gist.ac.kr/iadm/html/sub05/0503.html","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":"GIST: international graduate admissions FAQ"}]]}]]]}],"$undefined"]}]
27:["$","section","4-Original funding test: what cash is needed before the first payment?",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-5","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Original funding test: what cash is needed before the first payment?"}],[["$","p","Consider a fictional applicant whose tuition is supported but who must make an application payment, settle a matriculation charge and buy travel before any reimbursement. A budget that starts only with monthly rent misses the first decision the applicant must make.",{"children":"Consider a fictional applicant whose tuition is supported but who must make an application payment, settle a matriculation charge and buy travel before any reimbursement. A budget that starts only with monthly rent misses the first decision the applicant must make."}],["$","p","List every pre-arrival payment with its actual due date. Add only confirmed exemptions or benefits available by that date. In a separate line, show later reimbursement without spending it twice. Do not insert an invented exchange rate: keep the Korean-won commitments inKRW and any ticket quote in its quoted currency until you use a dated conversion for personal planning.",{"children":"List every pre-arrival payment with its actual due date. Add only confirmed exemptions or benefits available by that date. In a separate line, show later reimbursement without spending it twice. Do not insert an invented exchange rate: keep the Korean-won commitments inKRW and any ticket quote in its quoted currency until you use a dated conversion for personal planning."}]],"$undefined",[["$","p",null,{"className":"table-scroll-hint","children":"On a small screen, scroll the table sideways to compare all columns."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"guide-table-wrap","role":"region","aria-label":"Original funding test: what cash is needed before the first payment?","tabIndex":0,"children":["$","table",null,{"className":"guide-table","children":[["$","caption",null,{"children":"Original funding test: what cash is needed before the first payment?"}],["$","thead",null,{"children":["$","tr",null,{"children":[[["$","th","Record",{"scope":"col","children":"Record"}],["$","th","Check",{"scope":"col","children":"Check"}],["$","th","Action",{"scope":"col","children":"Action"}]],"$undefined"]}]}],["$","tbody",null,{"children":[["$","tr","0",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"Before submission"}],["$","td","1",{"children":"Application payment and documents"}],["$","td","2",{"children":"Use present cash"}]],"$undefined"]}],["$","tr","1",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"Before arrival"}],["$","td","1",{"children":"Confirmed charges and travel"}],["$","td","2",{"children":"Keep later reimbursement separate"}]],"$undefined"]}],["$","tr","2",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"After enrolment"}],["$","td","1",{"children":"Actual payment dates and conditions"}],["$","td","2",{"children":"Reconcile with living-cost plan"}]],"$undefined"]}]]}]]}]}],"$undefined"],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}]
28:["$","section","5-Check the official status and preserve a useful question",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-6","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Check the official status and preserve a useful question"}],[["$","p","The FAQ directs applicants to the online system for application status and does not offer email or post as a replacement submission method. If a technical problem occurs, record the error and use the published admissions contact; an email reporting the problem is not itself a valid application.",{"children":"The FAQ directs applicants to the online system for application status and does not offer email or post as a replacement submission method. If a technical problem occurs, record the error and use the published admissions contact; an email reporting the problem is not itself a valid application."}],["$","p","A focused funding question names the intended intake, degree and unclear component: for example, whether a dated public allowance table remains applicable or when a reimbursement can be claimed. Do not send bank credentials or a complete personal file in an initial enquiry. Retain the official reply with the current guide and eventual award conditions so the final budget reflects evidence rather than a copied headline.",{"children":"A focused funding question names the intended intake, degree and unclear component: for example, whether a dated public allowance table remains applicable or when a reimbursement can be claimed. Do not send bank credentials or a complete personal file in an initial enquiry. Retain the official reply with the current guide and eventual award conditions so the final budget reflects evidence rather than a copied headline."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","p",null,{"className":"table-source","children":["Official reference: ",[["$","span","https://www.gist.ac.kr/iadm/html/sub05/0503.html",{"children":["",["$","a",null,{"href":"https://www.gist.ac.kr/iadm/html/sub05/0503.html","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":"GIST: international graduate admissions FAQ"}]]}]]]}],["$","nav",null,{"className":"answer-links","aria-label":"Next steps for Check the official status and preserve a useful question","children":[["$","$L5","/scholarships/masters/",{"href":"/scholarships/masters/","children":["Compare master’s funding",["$","$L6",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$7:props:children:2:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}],["$","$L5","/guides/statement-of-purpose/",{"href":"/guides/statement-of-purpose/","children":["Prepare the research statement",["$","$L6",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$7:props:children:2:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}],["$","$L5","/guides/scholarship-application/",{"href":"/guides/scholarship-application/","children":["Check academic document organisation",["$","$L6",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$7:props:children:2:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}]]}]]}]
